.TH FLISTXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
flistxattr \- lists nul-separated attribute names on an open file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B ssize_t flistxattr(int descriptor, char* list, size_t size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists NUL-separated attribute names on an open file. A zero size queries the required length.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR flistxattr (2)
